  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Adviser to Samoa; supporting investment to the health sector in Samoa.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New Zealand&apos;s&#xA0;Health Adviser&#xA0;to Samoa supports targeted and effective&#xA0;investment to the health sector; primarily&#xA0;through strengthened relationships and supporting a partnership approach to all engagements between New Zealand and the health sector in Samoa.
The&#xA0;continuation of the role, following a successful initial six months, reflects New&#xA0;Zealand&#x2019;s ongoing commitment to support Samoa&#x2019;s vision of &#x201C;a healthy Samoa&#x201D;, and recognises&#xA0;how important, and complex, health programming is in Samoa.</narrative>
  </description>
